99921 FORMAT (/, 5X,
     1 'Domenicano, A., Vaciago, A. & Coulson, C.A. (1975). Acta',/,
     2 8X, 'Cryst. B31, 221-234.')
99922 FORMAT (/, 5X,
     1 'Duax, W.L., Weeks, C.M. & Rohrer, D.C. (1976). Topics in',/,
     2 8X, 'Stereochemistry,Vol.9, edited by N.L.Allinger & E.L.Eliel,'/
